    "short_label": {
      "en": "$tscsepi_rate5"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This is the second-band main pension insurance contribution rate for self-employed artisans and industry-and-trade workers, set at 0.6%, applied to income above the PSS ceiling (complementing the 17.75% first-band rate, $tscsepi_rate4). It is used as the Band_Rate parameter of the same SchedCalc in tscse_fr, 'ARTISAN & I&T: Pension insurance contributions for artisans & industry & trade (MAIN)'. The theme note's 'Self-Employed old age' entry confirms a matching rate of '0.6% above [1 PSS]' for the 2025 system (rising to 0.72% in 2026)."
    },
    "explanation": {
      "en": "EUROMOD function group: Parameters for self-employed contributions"
    },
